{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_01",
      "hash": "7a4c10300efd7ddb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "宝可梦在天空中飞翔的游戏\\n很不错吧……！\\c\\n如果真的能飞翔的话，\\n一定会比游戏还要有趣吧……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_02",
      "hash": "7a4c11300efd7f8e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嘿！你很在意吧！？\\n很在意我和这个机器吧！\\c\\n想要听听看吗！？\\n我会跟你详～细说明的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_03",
      "hash": "7a4c12300efd8141",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊，是这样……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_04",
      "hash": "7a4c13300efd82f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "没错！！\\n这台机器是可以让你……"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_05",
      "hash": "7a4c14300efd84a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在广阔的！蓝天！飞翔的！\\n了不起的！交通！工具！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_06",
      "hash": "7a4c15300efd865a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……我自己都觉得这发明很是伟大！\\n称它为[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘术[VAR COLOR(0000)]都毫不为过！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_07",
      "hash": "7a4c16300efd880d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可惜好不容易研制完成，\\n大家都不肯乘坐，让我很是头疼！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_08",
      "hash": "7a4c07300efd6e90",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "反正你看上去也挺勇敢的……\\c\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘术“凌空渡”[VAR COLOR(0000)]！\\n就让我教你它的乘坐方法吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_09",
      "hash": "7a4c08300efd7043",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "唉！？难道说那只\\n[VAR POKNAME(0002)]想要来控制！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_10",
      "hash": "7a4f15300effbc31",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "很不错～！\\n这正好完全符合我的灵感！\\r\\n那么，赶紧地……"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_11",
      "hash": "7a4f14300effba7e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "把这里这样再那样……\\n抓紧方向盘，我拉～！\\c\\n再把那个那样再这么一弄……\\n借助气球的力量，我飘～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub072_sys_01",
      "hash": "18c58e2029345768",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0003)]学会了\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘术“凌空渡”[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub072_sys_02",
      "hash": "18c5912029345c81",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "使用[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘术“凌空渡”[VAR COLOR(0000)]，\\n你就可以飞到\\r\\n曾经去过的城镇了！\\c\\n从X菜单的\\n“和[VAR PKNICK(0003)]玩”里\\r\\n选择“秘术”吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_12",
      "hash": "7a4f13300effb8cb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这台机器送给你们好了。\\n要多多在空中冒险啊！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_13",
      "hash": "7a4f12300effb718",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我的凌空渡好玩吗？\\c\\n我接下来\\n去研制什么机器好呢……"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub072_child_m_01",
      "hash": "1da1b925a9413f05",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 15]"
    },
